# The snapshot is the DATA, and it spans every project named in
# CAMBIUM_PROJECTS — including private repos and ones with no remote. The site
# in this directory is just code and is safe to publish; this file is not.
# Regenerate it with:  cambium-mcp export-snapshot --out snapshot.json --bodies
snapshot.json

# Exported pages are full entry prose from every named project. Same rule as the
# snapshot: this is the data, not the code.
# Regenerate with:  cambium-mcp export-pages --out vault
vault/
